<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal non-EU trade deficit narrows in 1996.</title>
<headline>Portugal non-EU trade deficit narrows in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's trade deficit with countries outside the European Union narrowed 9.3 percent in 1996 to 545.7 billion escudos, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		    Jan-Dec 96 Jan-Dec 95    Dec 96   Nov 96</p>
<p> Overall balance  -545.7     -601.9	 -43.2    -45.7</p>
<p> Imports	   1,282.7    1,281.1	 101.5    110.7</p>
<p> Exports	     737.0	679.2	  58.3     65.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit. 1995 figures are definitive while 1996 figures are preliminary.</p>
</text>
